    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simulates The\u00a0Look\u00a0&amp;\u00a0Feel Of\u00a0Old\u00a0Disk\u00a0Operating\u00a0Systems\u00a0(DOS).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Contains\u00a0Many\u00a0Easter\u00a0Eggs,\u00a0Advancements\u00a0And\u00a0An\u00a0Idle-Game\u00a0Points\u00a0System\u00a0(With\u00a0A\u00a0TSR\u00a0Program\u00a0That\u00a0Runs\u00a0When Started With The &quot;Idle&quot; Command).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Includes\u00a0A\u00a0Full\u00a0Custom\u00a0File-System\u00a0Format (&quot;MabelFS&quot;)\u00a0That\u00a0Reads\u00a0From\u00a0A\u00a0Virtual\u00a0Hard\u00a0Disk\u00a0Image.<br>All Save Data\u00a0Also Lives\u00a0On\u00a0The\u00a0Virtual\u00a0Disk,\u00a0So\u00a0Deleting\u00a0It Resets The Game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You Can Also Enable &quot;Hacker Mode&quot; With A Special Command, That Turns The Text Green, And Plays A Music Track.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With 12 Advancements\u00a0To Unlock, <br>2\u00a0Unique\u00a0Game\u00a0Modes\u00a0(Idle\u00a0Points &amp;\u00a0MabelEdit Text Editor),<br>There's Plenty Of\u00a0Keyboard-Jabbing\u00a0To Enjoy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NOTE:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The &quot;Hacker Mode&quot; Music Track Is A Placeholder I Made, To Avoid Copyright Issues.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simulates The\u00a0Look\u00a0&amp;\u00a0Feel Of\u00a0Old\u00a0Disk\u00a0Operating\u00a0Systems\u00a0(DOS).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Contains\u00a0Many\u00a0Easter\u00a0Eggs,\u00a0Advancements\u00a0And\u00a0An\u00a0Idle-Game\u00a0Points\u00a0System\u00a0(With\u00a0A\u00a0TSR\u00a0Program\u00a0That\u00a0Runs\u00a0When Started With The &quot;Idle&quot; Command).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Includes\u00a0A\u00a0Full\u00a0Custom\u00a0File-System\u00a0Format (&quot;MabelFS&quot;)\u00a0That\u00a0Reads\u00a0From\u00a0A\u00a0Virtual\u00a0Hard\u00a0Disk\u00a0Image.<br>All Save Data\u00a0Also Lives\u00a0On\u00a0The\u00a0Virtual\u00a0Disk,\u00a0So\u00a0Deleting\u00a0It Resets The Game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You Can Also Enable &quot;Hacker Mode&quot; With A Special Command, That Turns The Text Green, And Plays A Music Track.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With 12 Advancements\u00a0To Unlock, <br>2\u00a0Unique\u00a0Game\u00a0Modes\u00a0(Idle\u00a0Points &amp;\u00a0MabelEdit Text Editor),<br>There's Plenty Of\u00a0Keyboard-Jabbing\u00a0To Enjoy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NOTE:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The &quot;Hacker Mode&quot; Music Track Is A Placeholder I Made, To Avoid Copyright Issues.</p>",
    "short_description": "Simulates The\u00a0Look\u00a0&amp;\u00a0Feel Of\u00a0Old\u00a0Disk\u00a0Operating\u00a0Systems\u00a0(DOS). It Contains 12 Advancements,\u00a0An\u00a0Idle-Game\u00a0Points\u00a0System, And Text Editor. Includes\u00a0A\u00a0Full\u00a0Custom\u00a0File-System\u00a0Format (&quot;MabelFS&quot;) That\u00a0Reads\u00a0From\u00a0A\u00a0Virtual\u00a0Hard\u00a0Disk\u00a0Image.",
